docs\macos-arm64-plan.md:242: | 2 | Lima CLI, image templates, networking, or Rosetta integration changes underneath iolbox. | Medium / High | Declare supported Lima versions, lock guest URL/digest, isolate the adapter, test upgrade/downgrade, and retain remote x86_64 plus optional FEX paths. Kill automatic provisioning for an unqualified Lima major version. |
