  56: // The Hint* fields are an OPTIONAL client-asserted fingerprint (filled in by
  57: // the Windows launcher, which persists fingerprints across the ephemeral
  58: // guest disk â€” see tools/iolab-launcher/imagecache.go). The server only
  59: // trusts them when a cheap os.Stat of Path shows the file's current
  60: // (size, mtime) still matches HintSize/HintMTimeNs; any mismatch (or a
  61: // missing hint) falls back to a full re-hash via image.Inspect. This lets a
  62: // re-uploaded-but-unchanged image skip re-hashing a multi-hundred-MB file
  63: // inside the guest without ever trusting an unverified claim.
