 445:     // dragging over the canvas (App.svelte's onDragStart / CanvasInner's
 446:     // onDragOver). Consume it here rather than trusting e.shiftKey at drop
 447:     // time â€” the modifier can legitimately be released a frame before the
 448:     // drop event fires. When held, ask how many to place instead of
